    label "WIKI:4078"
    type "wiki"
    text "This is an incomplete list of operations conducted by the US Naval Special Warfare Development Group.&#10;&#10;&#10;== Invasion of Grenada ==&#10;&#10;On 14 March 1979 the People's Revolutionary Army, led by Maurice Bishop, overthrew the newly independent government of the small island of Grenada and established a new regime based on socialist principles."
  ]
