    id 135
    label "WIKI:2402"
    type "wiki"
    text "INSEAD has more than 60,000 alumni worldwide across its degrees, comprising more than 150 nationalities.&#10;The MBA program has produced the second-highest number of Fortune 500 CEOs, behind Harvard Business School."
  ]
